      {
        "id": 139932,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-28T14:45:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Most of this was said earlier, but:</p><p>5 heroes, put Fixer First, then Tachyon, then 3 reliable damage dealers. &nbsp;You want a target ready to destroy, a style in play, and knuckles and synaptic in hand. &nbsp;Then you knuckles, punch yourself (if you are higher health) play synaptic, then the next two have to make sure Tachyon is highest and Fixer is low enough to incap from 6 damage, then destroy a target, retaliation goes to tachyon, redirect to Fixer, unlock.</p>",
