      {
        "id": 139933,
        "name": "ScarecrowKing",
        "username": "ScarecrowKing",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/919ad9/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-28T15:20:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got him, but only due to the Chairman bug. No real tactics other than 'don't play tools'. Glad to finally unlock that one. I'm pretty sick of seeing both the Chairman and the Rook City decks. Maybe I'll go play a nice relaxing match against Spite.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now that I have DW Fixer, though,&nbsp;I'm realizing that his base power sucks so bad! I think I'd use vanilla&nbsp;Expat's ability before Bitter Strike.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-Brian</p>",
