      {
        "id": 139934,
        "name": "cmschex",
        "username": "cmschex",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-28T15:37:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Bitter Strike is actually pretty crazy with any hero who accelerates card play or when you treat Fixer's own cards like one shots (especially cool when you get Salvage Yard). &nbsp;It's also completely crazy with some heroes who aren't yet on the App - Sky Scraper, for example, typically has a ton of link cards that are left without targets or have used up their charge and she has a bunch ways to get them from her trash. &nbsp;Also, with the Dual Crowbars clarification Bitter Strike becomes even more powerful with Bloody Knuckles - with just those two cards and no buffs, Fixer does 6 damage to 1 targeta nd 9 to a second and then doesn't have to deal with the downside of Bloody Knuckles</p>",
        "post_number": 274,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:16:44.589Z",
