        "cooked": "<p>Oops! &nbsp;Definitely meant Twist the Ether. :D&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Thematically, having no weapon is probably what leads Mr. Fixer to having bloodied knuckles in the first place. &nbsp;Also, DW Fixer does well with other heroes who had no options but to play an ongoing they didn't want. &nbsp;Or Sky Scraper. :D</p>",
